@startuml SE_10_RateService
title Sequence Diagram: SE_10 Đánh giá dịch vụ
actor "Bệnh nhân" as Patient
participant "View\n(ReviewActivity)" as View
participant "ServiceController" as Controller
participant "ReviewService" as Service
participant "ServiceReviewRepository" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Patient -> View: Nhập sao & Đánh giá
activate View
View -> Controller: submitReview(reviewRequest)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: addReview(req)
activate Service
Service -> Repo: save(ServiceReview)
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO service_review...
Repo --> Service: success
Service --> Controller: ReviewResponse
Controller --> View: 200 OK
View --> Patient: Đã gửi đánh giá
deactivate View
@enduml